        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\ntitle COIT20246 - OpenWrt VirtualBox Lab Network Diagram\n\nskinparam backgroundColor white\nskinparam shadowing false\nskinparam defaultFontName Arial\n\nskinparam node {\n    BackgroundColor #E8F1FB\n    BorderColor #2F5597\n    FontColor #1F1F1F\n}\n\nskinparam rectangle {\n    BackgroundColor #F7F7F7\n    BorderColor #555555\n    FontColor #1F1F1F\n}\n\nskinparam cloud {\n    BackgroundColor #EAF4EA\n    BorderColor #548235\n}\n\nskinparam database {\n    BackgroundColor #FFF2CC\n    BorderColor #BF9000\n}\n\nskinparam arrow {\n    Color #444444\n    Thickness 2\n}\n\n&#39; =========================\n&#39; INTERNET / NAT SIDE\n&#39; =========================\n\ncloud \&quot;Internet\&quot; as INTERNET\n\nnode \&quot;VirtualBox\\nNAT Network\\nAdapter 2\&quot; as NAT {\n    rectangle \&quot;NAT\\n10.0.3.0/24\&quot; as NATNET\n}\n\nnode \&quot;OpenWrt VM\\nOpenWrt 22.03.3\&quot; as OPENWRT {\n    \n    rectangle \&quot;eth1\\nNAT Interface\\nIP: 10.0.3.15/24\\nMAC: 08:00:27:A8:F2:21\&quot; as ETH1\n    \n    rectangle \&quot;eth0\\nHost-only Interface\\nNo direct IP\\nMAC: 08:00:27:8C:E5:FF\&quot; as ETH0\n    \n    rectangle \&quot;br-mng\\nManagement Bridge\\nIP: 192.168.56.2/24\&quot; as BR\n    \n    rectangle \&quot;uhttpd Web Server\\nHTTP: TCP/80\&quot; as WEB\n    \n    rectangle \&quot;OpenWrt Management\\nTCP/81*\&quot; as MGMT\n    \n    ETH0 --&gt; BR\n    BR --&gt; WEB\n    BR --&gt; MGMT\n}\n\nINTERNET --&gt; NATNET\nNATNET --&gt; ETH1\n\n&#39; =========================\n&#39; HOST-ONLY SIDE\n&#39; =========================\n\nrectangle \&quot;VirtualBox\\nHost-only Network\\n192.168.56.0/24\&quot; as HOSTONLY\n\nnode \&quot;Windows Host\&quot; as WINDOWS {\n    rectangle \&quot;Ethernet 2\\nHost-only Adapter\\nIP: 192.168.56.1/24\&quot; as WINETH\n}\n\nWINDOWS --&gt; HOSTONLY\nHOSTONLY --&gt; BR\n\n&#39; =========================\n&#39; CONNECTION LABELS\n&#39; =========================\n\nETH1 -[hidden]- ETH0\n\nnote right of NAT\nVirtualBox Adapter 2\nAttached to: NAT\nend note\n\nnote left of HOSTONLY\nVirtualBox Adapter 1\nAttached to:\nHost-only Adapter\nend note\n\nnote bottom of OPENWRT\neth0 → br-mng\neth1 → NAT\n\nThe Windows host accesses\nOpenWrt through:\n192.168.56.1 → 192.168.56.2\nend note\n\nlegend right\n|= Component |= Configuration |\n| Windows Host | 192.168.56.1/24 |\n| OpenWrt br-mng | 192.168.56.2/24 |\n| OpenWrt eth0 | Host-only, no direct IP |\n| OpenWrt eth1 | 10.0.3.15/24, NAT |\n| VirtualBox Adapter 1 | Host-only |\n| VirtualBox Adapter 2 | NAT |\n| HTTP | TCP 80 |\n| Management | TCP 81* |\n\n* Port 81 is the assignment-required management interface\nand should be verified against the actual OpenWrt configuration.\n\nendlegend\n\n@enduml&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="LuQUXwOpF0KlzinZOJzt-1">
