  <diagram id="DiBcemMk8P3IwuL2kXQK" name="Page-2">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1894" dy="1013" grid="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="850" pageHeight="1100" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\ntitle COIT20246 - Proposed Small Business Production Network\n\n&#39; =========================================================\n&#39; GENERAL STYLING\n&#39; =========================================================\n\nskinparam backgroundColor white\nskinparam shadowing false\nskinparam defaultFontName Arial\nskinparam componentStyle rectangle\n\nskinparam rectangle {\n    BackgroundColor #F8F9FA\n    BorderColor #343A40\n    BorderThickness 2\n    FontColor #212529\n}\n\nskinparam node {\n    BackgroundColor #EAF2F8\n    BorderColor #2874A6\n    BorderThickness 2\n    FontColor #212529\n}\n\nskinparam cloud {\n    BackgroundColor #E8F8F5\n    BorderColor #138D75\n    BorderThickness 2\n}\n\nskinparam database {\n    BackgroundColor #FEF5E7\n    BorderColor #B9770E\n    BorderThickness 2\n}\n\nskinparam arrow {\n    Color #34495E\n    Thickness 2\n}\n\n&#39; =========================================================\n&#39; INTERNET\n&#39; =========================================================\n\ncloud \&quot;INTERNET\\nExternal Network\&quot; as INTERNET\n\ncloud \&quot;ISP\\nInternet Service Provider\&quot; as ISP\n\nINTERNET --&gt; ISP : Internet connection\n\n&#39; =========================================================\n&#39; BUSINESS ROUTER / FIREWALL\n&#39; =========================================================\n\nnode \&quot;OpenWrt Router / Firewall\&quot; as FIREWALL {\n\n    rectangle \&quot;WAN Interface\\nISP / Internet\\nExternal connection\&quot; as WAN\n\n    rectangle \&quot;LAN Interface\\n97.0.0.1/24\\nDefault Gateway\\nFirewall + NAT\&quot; as LAN\n\n    WAN --&gt; LAN\n}\n\nISP --&gt; WAN\n\n&#39; =========================================================\n&#39; INTERNAL BUSINESS SWITCH\n&#39; =========================================================\n\nnode \&quot;Business Ethernet Switch\\nLAN: 97.0.0.0/24\&quot; as SWITCH\n\nLAN --&gt; SWITCH : Protected LAN\n\n&#39; =========================================================\n&#39; WEB SERVER\n&#39; =========================================================\n\ndatabase \&quot;Business Web Server\\n\\nIP: 97.0.0.10/24\\nGateway: 97.0.0.1\\nHTTP/HTTPS\\nBusiness Website\&quot; as WEBSERVER\n\nSWITCH --&gt; WEBSERVER : Ethernet\n\n&#39; =========================================================\n&#39; STAFF WORKSTATIONS\n&#39; =========================================================\n\nrectangle \&quot;Business Manager\\nWorkstation\\n\\n97.0.0.20/24\\nGW: 97.0.0.1\&quot; as PC1\n\nrectangle \&quot;IT Support 1\\nWorkstation\\n\\n97.0.0.21/24\\nGW: 97.0.0.1\&quot; as PC2\n\nrectangle \&quot;IT Support 2\\nWorkstation\\n\\n97.0.0.22/24\\nGW: 97.0.0.1\&quot; as PC3\n\nrectangle \&quot;Business Consultant 1\\nWorkstation\\n\\n97.0.0.23/24\\nGW: 97.0.0.1\&quot; as PC4\n\nrectangle \&quot;Business Consultant 2\\nWorkstation\\n\\n97.0.0.24/24\\nGW: 97.0.0.1\&quot; as PC5\n\nrectangle \&quot;Business Consultant 3\\nWorkstation\\n\\n97.0.0.25/24\\nGW: 97.0.0.1\&quot; as PC6\n\nrectangle \&quot;Administration 1\\nWorkstation\\n\\n97.0.0.26/24\\nGW: 97.0.0.1\&quot; as PC7\n\nrectangle \&quot;Administration 2\\nWorkstation\\n\\n97.0.0.27/24\\nGW: 97.0.0.1\&quot; as PC8\n\n&#39; =========================================================\n&#39; STAFF CONNECTIONS\n&#39; =========================================================\n\nSWITCH --&gt; PC1\nSWITCH --&gt; PC2\nSWITCH --&gt; PC3\nSWITCH --&gt; PC4\nSWITCH --&gt; PC5\nSWITCH --&gt; PC6\nSWITCH --&gt; PC7\nSWITCH --&gt; PC8\n\n&#39; =========================================================\n&#39; NETWORK INFORMATION\n&#39; =========================================================\n\nnote right of SWITCH\nProduction LAN:\n97.0.0.0/24\n\nRouter:\n97.0.0.1\n\nWeb Server:\n97.0.0.10\n\nStaff:\n97.0.0.20 - 97.0.0.27\nend note\n\nnote bottom of FIREWALL\nOpenWrt provides:\n• Firewall protection\n• Network routing\n• NAT\n• Internet gateway\n• Controlled inbound/outbound traffic\nend note\n\n&#39; =========================================================\n&#39; PROJECT INFORMATION\n&#39; =========================================================\n\nlegend bottom\n|= Project Information |= Details |\n| Business | Brisbane IT &amp; Business Consultancy |\n| Student 1 | Pavan Reddy Chinthalapally - 12327397 |\n| Student 2 | Patel Ronak Ghanshyambhai - 12328755 |\n| Production Network | 97.0.0.0/24 |\n| Default Gateway | 97.0.0.1 |\n| Web Server | 97.0.0.10 |\n| Staff Workstations | 97.0.0.20 - 97.0.0.27 |\n| Network Security | OpenWrt Router / Firewall |\n\nendlegend\n\n@enduml&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="B-oQfpyck4zi2eZD34lQ-1">
          <mxCell connectable="0" parent="1" style="group;transparentBounds=1;editIcon=1;lockedGroup=0;groupPadding=10;" vertex="1">
